{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55808","headline":"示执坐禅者颂 · 省澄","name":"示执坐禅者颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道分明绝点尘，何须长坐始相亲。\n遇缘傥解无非是，处愦那能有故新。\n散诞肯齐支遁侣，逍遥曷与慧休邻。\n或游泉石或闤闠，可谓烟霞物外人。\n（按：《闽诗录丙集》卷十九录此诗作：「大道分明绝点尘，何须枯坐始相亲。\n杖藜日涉溪山趣，便是烟霞物外人。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"省澄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}